The rate of the reaction is given by:  
\[ \frac{d[NH_4\text{CHO}_2]}{dt} = -k[NH_4\text{CHO}_2] \]  
\[ \frac{d[NH_2\text{CONH}_2]}{dt} = +k[NH_4\text{CHO}_2] \]  

