     \[
     \text{Distance} = \text{Velocity} \times \text{Time}
     \]
     \[
     150 + x = 10 \times 25 = 250 \text{ m}
     \]

5. **Solve for the train's length**:
   \[
   x = 250 - 150 = 100 \text{ m}
   \]

