\[ v = v_0 + a t \]  
Solving for time:  
\[ t = \frac{v - v_0}{a} = \frac{35,000 \, \text{m/s} - 0}{4.8 \times 10^{11} \, \text{m/s}^2} = 7.25 \times 10^{-8} \, \text{s} \]  

