\]
Thus, the curl of \(\mathbf{V}(x, y)\) is:
\[
\nabla \times \mathbf{V} = \boxed{\frac{\partial \mathbf{V}_2}{\partial x} - \frac{\partial \mathbf{V}_2}{\partial y}}.
