In an elastic collision, if two bodies \( A \) and \( B \) with masses \( m_A \) and \( m_B \) collide with velocities \( v_A \) and \( v_B \) such that \( v_A : v_B = m_B : m_A \), what are their velocities after the impact?<end_of_turn>
