\[
\nabla \times \mathbf{V} = \frac{\partial \mathbf{V}_3}{\partial x} - \frac{\partial \mathbf{V}_2}{\partial y} + \frac{\partial \mathbf{V}_2}{\partial x} - \frac{\partial \mathbf{V}_3}{\partial y}.
